    "about": {
      "description": "rig is a CLI to install, remove, configure, and switch between multiple\nversions of R. It works on macOS, Windows and Linux, supports symbolic\nversion names (e.g. `release`, `devel`, `oldrel`), lets you run multiple\nR versions in parallel via quick links, and integrates with the\nRStudio and Positron IDEs.",
